{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Forge Your Dream City in Isoforge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast island, design your perfect city, and defend it against relentless invasions! Isoforge combines strategic city-building with dynamic events, giving you endless possibilities to shape your world. Are you ready to build, defend, and thrive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Whats included in the Demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo only includes the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One game mode with two map sizes (small and middle)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As many saves as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 soldier variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small selection of buildings (around 10)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tutorial, weather, invasions, settings\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo doesn\u2019t include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different languages (english only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attacking enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Effects, Additional Features that might be in the Full Game at a later point</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Additionally, you will only be able to play to Day 25 or Age 3 (for every save)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685880?t=1747424288","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685880?t=1747424288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685880/b51e3e9aa496b1561b5f6c966c9eceec7edb31d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747424288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685880/b51e3e9aa496b1561b5f6c966c9eceec7edb31d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747424288","categories":[{"description":"Sin